</span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    &#x3C;tr></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;th headers=\"region\">华东&#x3C;/th></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;td headers=\"q1 q1-sales\">200万&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;td headers=\"q1 q1-growth\">12%&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;td headers=\"q2 q2-sales\">250万&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      &#x3C;td headers=\"q2 q2-growth\">25%&#x3C;/td></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    &#x3C;/tr></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;/tbody></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/table></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;!-- 描述列表：术语定义 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;dl></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;dt>WCAG&#x3C;/dt></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;dd>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines&#x3C;/dd></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;dt>ARIA&#x3C;/dt></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  &#x3C;dd>Accessible Rich Internet Applications&#x3C;/dd></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;/dl></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>布局表格（仅用于排版的表格）应使用 <code>role=&quot;presentation&quot;</code> 告诉辅助技术忽略表格语义。但现代 Web 开发中应始终使用 CSS 布局代替表格布局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语义化 HTML 是无障碍的基础，辅助技术通过 HTML 语义构建可访问性树</li>\n<li>原生 HTML 元素（button、nav、main 等）自带 ARIA 角色，优先使用原生元素</li>\n<li>地标元素划分页面功能区域，多个同类地标必须用 aria-label 区分</li>\n<li>标题层级必须连续（不跳级），是屏幕阅读器用户导航页面的主要方式</li>\n<li>表单控件必须关联标签（label for），错误信息通过 aria-describedby 程序化关联</li>\n<li>数据表格使用 scope 和 headers 属性使辅助技术理解表头与数据的关系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语义化 HTML","id":"语义化-html"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"地标区域","id":"地标区域"},{"level":2,"text":"标题层级","id":"标题层级"},{"level":2,"text":"表单语义","id":"表单语义"},{"level":2,"text":"表格与列表语义","id":"表格与列表语义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WCAG 原则与标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/wcag-principles"},"next":{"title":"键盘导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/web-accessibility/keyboard-navigation"}}